  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHv/167",
  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-html\" data-ke-type=\"html\" data-source=\"&lt;div class=&quot;txc-textbox&quot; style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&amp;gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size23&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\"><div data-ke-class=\"article\"><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size23\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div></div></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">우리학교는 4단원을 먼저 시작하였고, 이제 1단원 수업 중입니다(말머리가 이전 교육과정으로 되어 있어 2단원으로 올렸어요.)</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">올해 신입생들은 무척 생기발랄하네요. 쉬지 않고 응대를 해야 할 정도입니다.&#160;^^</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">우리학교 아이들이 제일 잘 하는 종목(?) 중의 하나가 &#39;포스터로&#160;표현하기&#39;입니다.&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">지구계의 구성요소를 포스터로 표현하고(모둠별 하나의 작품) 발표해 보라고 하였더니 신나게 참여하였답니다. &#160;&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">너무 흔한 수업인데 자료를 올리려고 하니 선생님들에게 미안한 마음이 듭니다. 그래도 보여드리고 싶습니다.</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/990C073E5AD5940704\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/990C073E5AD5940704\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/73af1014c57541e109077addcc3b13cca16c1b8d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/73af1014c57541e109077addcc3b13cca16c1b8d\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6ada47352037d4fca7efb3adc29fd2e42bd469e0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6ada47352037d4fca7efb3adc29fd2e42bd469e0\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"768\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e527eef056ca9c24b20dd09d53d46472903c517b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e527eef056ca9c24b20dd09d53d46472903c517b\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9990843C5AD594552F\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9990843C5AD594552F\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"768\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c45cbd480864781772b5473e2b0dcaae59bdeb22\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c45cbd480864781772b5473e2b0dcaae59bdeb22\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
